      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>What's New</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Auto Update: toggle in Settings to check for updates once per day.</li>
          <li>Keyboard shortcuts: Cmd+1/2/3 to switch between Source, Edit, and View modes.</li>
          <li>Edit mode icon updated to match Obsidian's pencil-with-underline style.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
